<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">- Zigua Bible V ersion</book>
  <para style="toc3">Zek</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zekalia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Zekalia</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">ZEKALIA</para>
  <para style="iot">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Zekalia chadaha chitangwe chitabu cha Msuhi. Chitabu chenye china ntendele zihaidi. Ntendele ya nkongo (Sula 1-8) ina utambalisi wa muwoni yalavigwe mgati mo mhilimo wa 520 na 518 Kulisito henati Kwelekwa. Utambalisi uwo wa chiwoni nkanana zilozize wadamanywa kwa sila ya uwoni, na yahikiliza kugamba uzesi mhya we Inyumba ya Chohile kuliganyiza mzi wa Yelusalemu nakutende chilagiso cha kubula vipindi vihya vya luhulwila. Vipindi ivyo na vikongwe ni Chohile kwa kumsagula mtawala Zelubabeli na mlavya ntambiko mkulu Yoshua. Msuhi wa Waizulaeli kulagiswa kugoja kwa nkwina chipindi hadya Chohile naatawale mwe isi yose. Ntendele ya kaidi ye chitabu chino (sula 9-14) yahimiliza mwe mbuli mbili, ya nkongo ni mwe hali na mazwela yesimile ya uyo na atende mndima ywa Chohile kukonga utawala wa Chohile. Uyo alongwa kuga zumbe mzumizi na mhuda, zumbe yudya akunga ngoto ikwigalwa kukomwa. Mwe dilagano dihya wagondi wa Injili wa dokola ulosi uwo kulonga undima wa Yesu ukunga ukubanika kwakwe kaula Matayo 21:4-5; 26:31, Mako 14:27.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mwitango wa kumuwiya Chohile, sula 1:1-6</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Uwoni mnane wa Maono Zekalia, sula 1:7-6:8</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Kutambaliswa kwa Yoshuwa, sula 6:9-15</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Mbuli ya kufunga, sula 7-8</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Nkanto na wambulwa, sula 9-13.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />Mo mwezi wa mnane mhilimo wa kaidi wo ulongozi seuta Dalio ywa Siliya, Zumbe kalonga kamwinka ulosi muoni Zekalia mwana ywa Belekiya, mwezukulu ywa Ido, kugamba <verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />“Miye, Chohile nasiweihiwa vitendese wakale wenyu. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" />Elo, wagambile wantu kugamba Miye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose ‘Niwiyani miye nami naniwawiyeni nyuwe. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" />Msekutenda enga wakale wenyu, awo wagambilagwa ni wawoni wa chikale waleke mijendele yawo ihiye na ntendwa zawo zihiye, mna wowo hawanitegeleze naho hawanizumile miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" />Wakale wenyu, we kuhi? Hegu wawoni, togolani, wekala mazuwa yose? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" />Togolani, wakale wenyu hawenkigwe nkanto kwa chausa cha kulemela malagizo yangu na sigilizi zangu niwenkile kwa sila ya wandima wangu wawoni? Chipindi icho, wowo na waneila na kugamba miye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose nasekamba kuwatenda kuligana ne mijendele yawo na ntendwa zawo, naho chindedi nivyo niwadamanye.’”<verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa nkongo wakwela Falasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />Mwe dizuwa dya milongo midi na nne dyo mwezi wa mlongo na imwe, kugamba mwezi wa Shebati, mhilimo wa kaidi wo ulongozi wa Dalio, ulosi wa Chohile unizila miye muwoni Zekalia mwana ywa Belekiya, mwezukulu ywa Ido. <verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" />Umo nechilo, simwona mndima ywa kwembingu kakwela falasi inkundu. Mndima ywa kwembingu uyo nendile kachimala kwedi kolongo, hagatigati he miti ya mihadasi. Mnyuma mwakwe na kuna falasi ntuhu zinkundu na zichivu na zing'aile. <verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" />Niyo nauza, “Zumbe, Falasi zino zina ndege yani?” Uyo mndima ywa kwembingu alongile na miye anigamba, “Nahulagise izi falasi izo zina ndege yani. <verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" />Wano nawo wasigilwe ni Chohile kuzuza mwe isi.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />Wakwela falasi niyo wamuza uyo mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile endile achimale hagatigati he miti ye mihadasi, “Chiizuza isi yose, naho chindedi itondowala.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" />Naho yudya mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile agambile, “Weye Chohile ywa wagomba nkondo, kwa chipindi chihi nojendeleze na kutenda hwina mbazi ya mzi wa Yelusalemu na mizi ye isi ya Yuda idya wiwonele maya kwa chipindi cha mihilimo milongo mfungate?”<verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" />Chohile kamwinka uyo mndima ywa kwembingu hitulo dyedi dina msuhi <verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" />Ivyo, uyo mndima ywa kwembingu anigamba, “Waungigwa kutambalisa kwa izwi kugamba Chohile ywa wagomba nkondo agamba vino, ‘Moyo wangu umema ungi wa mzi wa Yelusalemu, heye, kolugulu lwa Sayuni. <verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" />Mna sihizwa vitendese ni wantu we izisi ntuhu wakweduvya kugamba wekala mpeho. Chindedi nasiwaihiwa Waizulaeli hadodo, mna wantu we izisi ntuhu izo wawongezezaga file. <verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" />Elo, miye Chohile nagamba, nauwiya umzi wa Yelusalemu kwa mbazi, umo Inyumba yangu naizengwe, na uzesi mhya wo mzi naukonge.’”<verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" />Akaheza uyo mndima ywa kwembingu anigamba nitambalise uno ulosi mtuhu, “Chohile ywa wagomba nkondo agamba, ‘Mizi yangu neimeme ulozo vituhu. Miye Chohile na niutunye vituhu mzi wa Sayuni na niusagule mzi wa Yelusalemu utende wangu.’”<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa kaidi, Mahembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18" />Mo uwoni mtuhu, siwona mahembe mane. <verse eid="ZEC 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19" />Miye niyo namuza yudya mndima ywa kwembingu alongile na miye, “Mahembe yano yalagisa bwani?” Uyo anihitula, “Mahembe yano yalagisa wadya awantu we izisi ntuhu wawatimulaganya wantu wa Yuda, Izulaeli na Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20" />Akaheza, Chohile anilagisa wafula vyuma wane. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21" />Miye niyo nauza, “Wantu wano weza kutenda mbwani?” Uyo anihitula, “Wantu wano weza kuwatisa na kuwakoma wadya awantu mwe izisi zina nguvu wayebungaga isi ya Yuda na kuwatimulaganya awantu wakwe.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa katatu, Luzigi lwa kuhimila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />Mwe uwoni mtuhu, simwona mntu endile naluzigi lwa kuhimila mwe mikono yakwe. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />Ivyo, namuza, “Waita kuhi?” Uyo anihitula, “Naita kwe kuhima utali no uzangalamu wo mzi wa Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />Yuda mndima ywa kwembingu alongile namiye atenda ambasa mndima ywa kwembingu mtuhu yudya endile akamwizila. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" />Ivyo, uyo mndima ywa kwembingu alongile namiye amgamba uyo mnyawe, “Guluka ukamgambile yudya mbwanga kugamba sio budi umzi wa Yelusalemu utende na chiwambaza, ukata nkani haha tende na luhenyo lwa kuwachinta wekazi wakwe wenji ne zindimo nezitende mndani mwakwe. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" />Chohile mwenye agamba kuga mwenye natende chiwambaza cha moto kuudima umzi uwo ntendele zose, naye neekale umo kwa utakaswa wakwe.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">We kosamizo wetangwa wauye kaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />Chohile agamba vino, “Handikoni! Gulukani mwe isi yo lailo wa zuwa kudya miye nendile nasiwamwaganisani chila ntendele. <verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />Sunguzani! Nyuwe wose mkwikala mwe isi ya Babuloni, gulukilani ukokomzi wa Siyoni!” <verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" />Chohile wawa nkondo, yudya kwa utakaswa wakwe kanisigila, agama vino mwama taifa yawakumpile wantu wakwe, “Taile, naawadonte nyuwe adonta izingohe ze diziso dyangu. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" />Taile, nanitende chisimo mwao wawa kumpileni, wowo nawakumpwe ni wadya wawa tendile watumwa wawo.” Aho naho nammanyize kugamba Chohile wawa nkondo nuyo anisigile.<verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" />Chohile agamba vino, “Nyuwe wantu wa Siyoni, chemani na kwelelwa kwaviya neza na kwikala mgati mwenyu.<verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" />Mataifa menji na newehange namiye Chohile, awo nawo nawatende wantu wangu; miye nami nanikale mgati mwenyu.” <verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" />Wantu wa Yuda nawatende naho wa Chohile uyodu mwe isi itakate, no mzi wa Yelusalemu nautende naho mzi wakwe asagule.<verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" />Nyuwe wantu wose, mnyamale mo uso wa Chohile, kwaviya, uyo eza akalawa ko wikazi wakwe yatakate.<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa kane, Mlavyantambiko mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />Mo uwoni mtuhu, Chohile kanilagisa mlavyantambiko mkulu Yoshua kachimala kulongozi kwa mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile, na ntendele yakwe ya kulume kachimala Shetani amlahe. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile amgamba Shetani, “Zumbe Chohile nakukwahile weye Shetani! Zumbe Chohile ausagule umzi wa Yelusalemu na akuligite! Mntu yuno ni saviya chizinga chipempulwe mwe moto!”<verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" />“Chipindi icho mlavyantambiko mkulu Yoshua akatenda kavala suche zivumile nendile kachimala kulongozi kwa mndima ywa kwembingu.” <verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" />Mndima ywa kwembingu niyo awagamba wandima weyawe watuhu, “Mlavyantambiko mkulu Yoshua mvuleni izisuche zakwe zivumile.” Akaheza amgamba mlavyantambiko mkulu Yoshua, “Kaula, masa yako siyausa, miye nahuvise suche za yombe kulu.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" />Elo, niyo nawagamba wamvise chilemba chedi mo mtwi. Ivyo wamvisa chilemba chedi na suche, uyo mndima ywa kwembingu wa Chohile nendile kachimala aho.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile kamfunda mlavyantambiko mkulu Yoshuwa, akamgamba, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" />“Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose nkondo agamba ‘Unatimila viya hunga na kutoza izisigilizi zangu, ivyo nochimaile Inyumba yangu ne zinyuwa zakwe. Miye nahudahize kwingila mo undima wangu saviya wano wachimale kulongozi kwangu. <verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" />Weye Yoshua mlavyantambiko mkulu tegelezesa, hamwenga na wambizi wako wihamwenga nawo, nyuwe mwi saviya chilagiso cha mbuli zedi zikwiza. Kwaviya nanigale mndima ywangu akwitangwa Tambi. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" />Kaulani sika yuwe kulongozi kwa Yoshua yuwe idyo dina ntendele mfungate. Miye nansongole mawandiko mlanga mwakwe, na kwa zuwa dimwenga nanuse masa ye ino isi. Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose. <verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" />Zuwa idyo, chila yumwenga namgoneke mnyawe ekale hasi he mizabibu ne mitini yakwe. Akulonga ni Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose.’”<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa kane, Kinala cha taa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />Yudya mndima ywa kwembingu alongile namiye, kanizila viyuhu, aninula enga kwinula mntu mwe ntongo. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" />Anuza, “Wawona mbwani?” Miye niyo namhitula, “Nawona chinala cha taa cha zahabu. Mlanga mwakwe kuna bakuli dya mavuta na taa mfungate, na chila chimwenga china hantu hakujela ntambi mfungate. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" />Haguhi ne kinala icho kuna miti midi ya mizeituni, umwenga ntendele ya kulume na mtuhu ntendele ya kumoso.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />Ivyo, namuza uyo mndima ywa kwembingu, “Zumbe, vintu vino vyahima ndege yani?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />Uyo anihitula, “Humanyize vintu vino vina ndegeyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:5">“Bule, Simanyize seuta.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" />Uyo anigamba naho nilonge ulosi uno wa Chohile wa Zelubabeli, “Chohile wawa nkondo agamba vino, Hukudaha kuhuda kwa nguvu hegu kwa udahi wako wemwenye, mna kwa wamizi wa loho ywangu. Miye Chohile wawa nkondo silonga.” Ezila 5:2 <verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" />Naho, ongezeza kulonga, “Togola, lugulu luno ni finge? Dya! Weye Zelubabeli noliganyize. Weye nokonge uzesi mhya wa nyumba ya kuvikila, na mwe chipindi nawike idi yuwe dya nkomelezo, wantu nawavine wakagamba, ‘Nidyedi! Taile ni dyedi!’”<verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />Ulosi wa Chohile unizila, <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" />“Zelubabeli kaika umsingi we nyumba yo kuvikila uyo naho naibindilize. Ayo umo yakalaila, wantu wangu nawamanye kugamba miye Chohile wawa nkondo nimiye nikusigile kwao.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10" />Uyo mndima ywa kwembingu anigamba, “Izo taa mfungate ni meso mfungate ya Chohile yakuona chila hantu mwe isi.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" />Miye sijendeleza kuuza, “Togola, iyo imiti imidi ye mizaituni ikwe ntendele ya kulume na kumoso we kinala, ina ndege yani? <verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />Na ayo amatambi amaidi ye mizaituni mnkanda mwe mifilimbi midi ye zahabu mudya mavuta ye mizeituni yakujuluzika, yana ndege yani?!” <verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />Uyo anigamba, “Bule, simanyize Zumbe!” <verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />Aho anigamba, “Wano nawo wadya wantu waidi wadya Zumbe ywe dunia yose awasagulaga kwa kuwenka mavuta, wamsankanile.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="s">Lagano dya Chohile kwa Zelubabeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />Eze nikaule vituhu nasiwona chitabu chikupuluka mlanga. <verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" />Yudya mndima ywa kwembingu niyo anuza, “Wawona mbwani?” Miyenami niyo namhitula, “Naona chitabu chikupilika mlanga utali wakwe ni mpima nne na nusu.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" />Ivyo, uyo anigamba, “Mndani mwe chitabu icho mwandikwa ligito diya na difanyanywe si injima. Ntendele imwenga iwandikwa kugamba wabavi wose nawabalazwe mwe isi, na ntendele ntuhu iwandikwa kugamba wose wata kwelisa kwa udanti nawo nawadamanywe seivyo. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" />Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose agamba uyo mwenye negale idiligito idyo. Nadingile chila nyumba ya mbavi na chila nyumba ya elisize kwa kujinkila zina dyakwe; na dikale umo na kwikoma inyumba iyo yose, mbao na mayuwe.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa mfungate, Mvyele mwe ntangulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Yudya mndima ywa kwembingu alongile na miye kanisogeila, anigamba, “Handiko kaula uwone chiya chikwiza.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" />Miye niyo namuza, “Icho ni chintu chani?” Uyo anihitula, “Iyo ni ntangulu ina wavu.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Ntangulu yenye naina ngubiko idamanywe na chumbu niyo yagubulwa, miye siwona mvyele ekale umo mndani.<verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />Yudya mndima ywa kwembingu anigamba, “Uyo mvyele kegala wavu!” Akaheza uyo mndima ywa kwembingu kamsindikila mndani mwe ntangulu uyo mvyele na kuigubika. <verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />Eze nikaule kulanga, siwona wavyele waidi walaila wanibasa, nendile waka piliswa ni nkung'unto, nawo nendile wana mawawa yana nguvu enga ya nkolongo. Wavyele awo niyo wainula idya intangulu kulanga.<verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />Ivyo, niyo namuuza yudya mndima ywa kwembingu alongile na miye, “Waigala kuhi idya intangulu?”<verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />Anihitula, “Waigala mwe isi ya Babeloni. Uko na waizengele nyumba ya kuvikila na umo ikaheza, nawaike intangulu iyo mndani.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa Malingisha mane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />Nasikaula kulanga vituhu, niyo nawona malingisha mane yeza yalawa hagati gati he magulu maidi ya shaba. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" />Lingisha dya nkongo nadikakweswa ni falasi zinkundu na lingisha dya kaidi nadikakweswa ni falasi ntitu, <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" />lingisha dya katatu nadikakweswa ni falasi zing'aile, na lingisha dya kane na dikakweswa ni falasi zichivu. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />Elo, niyo namuza yudya mndima ywa kwembingu alongile na miye, “Sekulu malingisha yano yalagisa mbwani?”<verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" />Mndima ywa kwembingu niyo anihitula, “Malingisha yano ni loho nne za kwe mbingu. Nendile zikulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile ywe isi yose, haluse zahalawa zakudamanya ndima yakwe.<verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Lingisha diya dikukweswa ni zifalasi zititu dyaita ntendele ya chenya na diya dikukweswa ni zifalasi zing'aile dyaita ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa, diya dikukweswa ni zifalasi zichivu dyaita ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi.” <verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Falasi izo zijimbale vyedi zize zilaile nendile zina nkwina vitendese ya kwita kuizuza isi. Uyo mndima ywa kwembingu niyo azigamba, “Hitani mkaizuze isi.” <verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Akaheza yudya alongile na miye anigamba kwa izwi, “Kaula! Ziya izifalasi zitile ntendele ya chenya zihoza amaya ya Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua atendwa chilongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Zumbe Chohile niyo anilagisa ulosi mtuhu anigamba, <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10" />“Hokela majeleko ya chumbu na zahabu kulawa kwa watu we ko usamizo ziletigwe ni Helidai na Tobiya na Yedaya. Hita kwe nyumba ya Yosia mwana ywa Sefaniya ivino dyelo, nuko weli weza kulawa Babeli. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11" />Guha chumbu ne zahabu iyo, udamanye chilemba umvise mlavyantambiko mkulu Yoshua mwana ywa Yehosadaki, <verse eid="ZEC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" />mgambe Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose agamba, ‘Hano hana mntu akwitangwa Tambi. Uyo simsagula atende mntu mkulu chani azenge Inyumba yangu miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" />Uyo nuyo nazenge Inyumba yangu miye Zumbe Chohile, nenkigwe ntunyo ya chiseuta na kulongoza wantu wose. Natende mlavyantambiko mkulu. Aho nahatende na utondowazi mgati mwe wantu waidi. <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Vilemba ivyo navitende lukumbusa mwe Inyumba ya Chohile kuwatunya Helidai na Tobiya na Yedaya na Yosiya mwana ywa Sefaniya.’”<verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />“Wantu wakwikala si za hale naweze kwambiza kuizenga Inyumba yangu miye Chohile.” Nyuwe naywi nammanye kugamba Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose nuyo anitumile kwenyu. Vyose ivyo navilaile uneva mnatimila amalagizo ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli yo kufuga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />Mo mhilimo wa kane wo ulongozi seuta Dalio, zuwa dya kane dyo mwezi wa chenda, kugamba Kisilevu, ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile unizila miye Zekalia.<verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2" />Wantu wo mzi wa Beteli nendile wawatuma Shalesa na Legemu Meleki hamwenga na wantu wawo vileke walombeza mbazi za Zumbe Chohile, <verse eid="ZEC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3" />iviya wawauza walavyantambiko we Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose na wawoni ulosi uno, “Togolani, chijendeleze kulombeza na kufunga mo mwezi wa shano enga viya chidamanye kwe chipindi che mihilimo ino ilozize?”<verse eid="ZEC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Aho, ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose niyo wanizila, <verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" />“Wagambile vino wekazi wose we ino isi na walavyantambiko, ‘Kwa chipindi cha mihilimo milongo mfungate ijinkile, nyuwe nendile mkafunga na kulomboleza mo mwezi wa shano na wa mfungate. Togolani, mwafanyanya namkafunga kwa chausa changu? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" />Togolani, umo mkadya na kunywa, gamba mwadya na kunywa kwa chausa chenyu nyuwe wenye?’<verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" />Zino nizo izimbuli miye Zumbe Chohile nawagambilagani kujinkila kwa wawoni wa aho nkongo, umo umzi wa Yelusalemu hamwenga ne imizi iuzunguke umo yatondowale na kuchumilwa, umo imizi ya Negebu ne idibwandasi dya Shefele mkekalwa ni wantu walozize.”<verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />Ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile niyo wamwizila vituhu Zekalia, <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9" />“Miye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose nagamba, Lamulani vikuwagila, naho mhole, chila yumwenga amuwonele mbazi mnyawe. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10" />Msekuwabunyanya wabanikilwe ni wagosi zawo hegu wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo, wajeni hegu wachiwa; msekwekamba kudamanyizana mbuli zihiye nyuwe wenyu kwa wenye.”<verse eid="ZEC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" />“Mna wantu nawalemela kunitegeleza, wahiga na kusita magutwi yawo chani wasekwiva. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" />Myoyo yawo waitenda midala enga yuwe, wanase kwetegeleza isigilizi yangu miye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose nilongile kujinkila wawoni walongole. Elo, miye Zumbe niyo nemukwa ni maya vitendese, <verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" />niyo nagamba, ‘Kwaviya nasiwetanga mna hawanitegeleze, elo, wowo nawo weze wanitange, siwetegeleze. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" />Saviya luzimu lukufilisiza vintu, wantu wangu siwahosa wamwaganikane mgati mwa wantu we izisi ntuhu uko watendile wajeni. Isi wasize niyo yasigala ibule, hahana mntu yoyose ekale umo. Nivyo waitendile isi iyo naikawagiza itenda ibule.’”<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile naujimbike umzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose niyo wanizila vituhu miye Zekalia, kugamba, <verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />“Wantu wa Yelusalemu nawaunga, wantu awo nawaungisa, naho wankondo wawo naweihiwa. <verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" />Yelusalemu ni mzi nisagule, nanuye na kwika wikazi wangu umo. Chipindi icho mzi wa Yelusalemu nawitangwe ‘Mzi mkanuni kwa Chohile na lugulu lwangu miye Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose nalwitangwe, Lugulu Lusagulwe ni Chohile.’ <verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Miye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose nagamba, Wadalahala wagosi kwa wavyele, nawawoneke kwa nkanana ntuhu wekala mwe zinkwikwi za Yelusalemu, chila yumwenga na kome dyakwe kwaviya kadalahalisa. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Sila za Yelusalemu nazimeme wabwanga na wandele, wakaseziga umo.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" />Miye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose nagamba, “Mbuli izo zadaha ziwoneke zakwehela mwa wantu wasigale ichipindi icho, mna togola zadaha kutenda zehela mwangu? Akulonga ni Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose. <verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" />Naniwakombole wantu wangu kulawa kwe isi ya ulailo wazuwa na kulawa kwe isi ya uswelo wa zuwa, <verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" />na kuwatenda wekale mo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Awo nawatende wantu wangu, miye nami nanitende Chohile ywawo, miye nanidamanye viya nilongile”.<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose Chohile agamba vino, “Nyuwe mkuziva zino izimbuli zikulongwa vino haluse ni wawoni awo watendekaga weyaho umo ichegamo che Inyumba yangu chikazengwa, mikono yenyu idindimale vileke Inyumba ya Chohile izengwe. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />Chipindi icho hechinati kubula, hakwendaga na maliho kwa mntu hegu mnyama. Hakwendile na akudamanya ndimakwe akatenda mpeho kwachausa cha wankondo wenyu, kwaviya nasisongaganya chila mntu na mnyawe. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Mna vino haluse wantu wano wasigale saniwatendele saviya we chikale. Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose. <verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" />Vino haluse nakutende na utondowazi mwe isi, fula nainye saviya vizweleke, sanga nailavye ulozo na mizabibu nayeleke vitendese. Wantu wangu wasigale we ino isi naniwenke iyo vyose vitende ugoli wawo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" />Nyuwe wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Izulaeli! Chipindi chijinkile nyuwe namkawoneka kugamba mligitwa mgati mwa wantu wa we izisi ntuhu. Mna haluse miye naniwakomboleni, naywi namtende wantu wajimbikwe. Ivyo, msekogoha vituhu, mdindimale!”<verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zoseo agamba, “Saviya nekambile kuwadamanyiza nyuwe mbuli zihiye kwaviya wakale wenyu waniihizaga, naho siwawonele mbazi, <verse eid="ZEC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15" />seivyo sekamba kuwadamanyiza yedi wantu wa Yelusalemu na wantu wa Yuda. Ivyo, msekogoha. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" />Ivyo nivyo mkungwa mdamanye. Chila yumwenga alonge ichindedi kwa mnyawe. Vitala vyenyu vilamule nkanto zikuwagila zikuhosa utondowazi. <verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />Mntu yoyose mgati mwenyu asekwekamba kumdamanyiza wihi mwe mnyawe, naho msekwelisa udanti, kwaviya mbuli izo naziihiwa vitendese. Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile, silonga.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose unizila vituhu miye Zekalia, <verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" />Miye Zumbe Chohile nagamba, “Mazuwa yo mfungo wa mwezi wa kane na mwezi wa shano na mwezi wa mfungate na mwezi wa mlongo, nayatende mazuwa ya chinyemi na mbwedo, nayatende mazuwa makulu ya mbwedo kwa wantu wa Yuda. Ivyo, munge uchindedi na utondowazi.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose agamba, “Wantu walozize we izisi ntuhu za chijeni na wekazi wa mizi ilozize nawengilizane mo mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" />Wekazi wa mzi umwenga nawawabase wekazi wa mzi mtuhu na kuwagamba, ‘Chiteni hamwenga chikamvikile Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose na kumlombeza ujimbiko!’ <verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Iviya wantu wa makabila yalozize na wantu wa si zina nguvu naweze Yelusalemu kumvikila Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose na kumlombeza ujimbiko. <verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" />Miye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose nagamba, Wantu mlongo kulawa mwa amalonga yose mwe izisi nawamkagatile Myahudi yumwenga na kutoza isuche yakwe na kumgamba, ‘Chaunga chite hamwenga na weye kwaviya chigambilwa kugamba Chohile ehamwenga na nyuwe.’”<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="s">Nkanto mwa wankondo wa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />Ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">kulanga isi ya Hadilaki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">na umzi wa Damesiki nahatende ni hantu hangu ha kuhumula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">Kwaviya wantu wose na makabila yose ya Izulaeli nayahinge kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" />Iviya hata umzi wa Hamati ukuhakana na Hadilaki na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">mzi wa Tilo na Sidoni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">hata hegu wewona wana ubala utendese.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Wantu wo uzi wa Tilo wezengela chiwambaza chitogese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:3">welimbikiziza chumbu enga tifili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:3">na zahabu enga mazagalika mwe sila.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />Mna Zumbe naguhe ivintu vyakwe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:4">ugoli wakwe naujele mwe bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:4">na kuutikimya moto umzi uwo. <verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />Wantu wo uzi wa Ashikeloni nawawone mbuli izo na wogohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Wantu wo umzi wa Gaza nawawone mbuli izo kogoha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Wantu wa Ekuloni waika msuhe mwe vintu, mna vintu ivyo havilaile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Seuta ywo umzi wa Gaza nakomwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">na umzi wa Ashikeloni hawikalwe ni wantu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Mzi wa Ashidodi na wikalwe ni wantu wajeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:6">Chohile agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:6">“Kweduvya kwa Wafilisi kubula udumo.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />Nanichinde kudya nyama ina sakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">na nkande ilemezwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">Wantu nawasigale nawatende wantu wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">enga ni wantu wa lukolo ywa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">Wantu wa Ekulonia nawatende enga ni wantu wa Yebusi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />Miye naniidime isi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">nani chinde wankondo wase kujinkajinka umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">Hahana mntu nawabunyanye naho wantu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">kwaviya, kwa meso yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">siwona ivyo wasulumizwe.”<verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe ywa utondoazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />Bwedani nyuwe wantu wa Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Gutani, nyuwe wantu wa Yelusalemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Kaula Zumbe dyenyu eza kwenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">eza kwa uwagila na wambula!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Kahola naho kakwela mpunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">heye mwana mpunda.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />Malingisha ya nkondo mwe isi ya Efulaimu naniyause,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">na falasi za nkondo zikulawa komzi wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">Mita ya nkondo naivunwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">Natambalise utondowazi mwa wantu we izisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">Nalonhgoze kulawa bahali kubula bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">na kulawa ko mto Efulati kubula uhelo we isi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvuzwa kwa wantu wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />Zumbe Chohile agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">“Kwachausa cha lagano dyangu na nyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">lagano dilagiswe kwa sakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">naniwakombole wafungwa wenyu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">wesaviya wafungigwe mwe bome dibule.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />Nyuwe wafungwa wata msuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">uyani kwe nkambi yenyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">Haluse miye natambalisa kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">naniwavuzizeni yedi nkanana mbili.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />Wantu wa Yuda naniwajeseze uge uta wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">Wantu wa Efulaimu naniwajeseze uge msale wangu kuwebunga wankondo wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">Wantu wa Sayuni naniwajeseze enga bamba kuwebunga wantu wa Ugiliki!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">Nawatende enga bamba dya mkankalu.”<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />Chohile nawalaile wantu wakwe;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">nakunte misale yakwe enga umeme.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">Zumbe Chohile natowe gunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">najende mwe luzimu kulawa kwa mwenyemzi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose nawadime wantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">nawo nawawakome wankondo wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">Nawatule lwasu kwe nkondo uge wakozi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">nawetile sakame ya wankondo wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">Naijuluzike uge sakame ya ntambiko ijuluzwe mwe mazabahu kulawa mwe bakuli.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo, nawakombole mwe idizuwa idyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">kwaviya awo ni wantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">nawo nawang'ale mwe isi yakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">enga mayuwe yana yombekulu mwe chilemba.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />Wantu nawatende watana na kutamila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">Wabwanga na wandele nawadamane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">kwa kudya nkande na kunywa divai mpya.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="s">Chohile aika lagano dya ukombola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />Mlombezeni Zumbe Chohile anyese fula za masika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">Chohile nuyo akudamanya maingu ya fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">nuyo akuwenka wantu mawaga ya fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">ahosa ulozo ukule mwe kukuza nkande mwezi nkonde ya chila mntu.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />Matukulu yalonga udanti, walaguzi wawona uwoni wo udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">watamwila sozi zo udanti, wahoza wantu kwa mbuli zi bule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">Nivyo vikuleka wantu wangadika uge ngoto zagile, hezina mdimi.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">“Simukwa ni maya kwachausa cha awo wadimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">vilongozi awo miye naniwakantile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">Miye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">naniwadime awantu wangu, lukolo lwa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">Naniwatende wakankalu uge falasi za nkondo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />Kulawa kwa awelekwa wa Yuda nakulaile vilongozi watindivu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">nawatoge uge yuwe ditogese dya kuzengela mwe mpembe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">nawatende watogesa uge chijinji cha hema</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">watogese enga chijinji cha hema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">nawatende na nguvu unge uta ukwesigwe ukunte misale.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Wantu wa Yuda nawatende wahuda uge wakankalu wa kugomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">wakujata wankondo wawo mwe sila ina ntagata, kwaviya miye Chohile nihamwenga nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">awo nawawahude hata wakwela falasi.”<verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />“Wantu wa Yuda nani watogeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">welekwa wa Yusufu naniwakombole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">Naniwavuze kwawo kwaviya nawawona mbazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">Nawatende uge kugamba sawalemelaga. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo, malombezo yawo naniyahitule.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Wantu wa Efulaimu nawatende uge wakankalu wa nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">nawameme chinyemi uge wantu wanywele divai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">Wana wawo nawayawone ichinyemi icho na kwelelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">nawameme chinyemi mwe myoyo kwachausa changu miye Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />“Naniwetange wantu wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:8">nakuwalunja hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:8">sekamba kuwakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:8">nawo nawatende waloza uge aho nkongo<verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />Hata hegu nawatimulaganya mgati mwa wantu we izisi ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">wakatenda weyuko nawanikumbuke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">Awo hamwenga na wana wawo nawatende na ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">na kuya mwe zinyumba zawo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />Naniwavuze kulawa kwe isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">naniwalunje kulawa kwe isi ya Ashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">naniwalete kwe isi ya Gileadi na Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">wowo nawameme chila hantu mwe isi.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />Nawajinkile mwe bahali ya masulumizo yalozese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">miye nami nani yatowe amawimbi yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">ne mizumilizo ya mazi yo mto Naili nainyale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">Kweduvya kwa Waashulu nakuswe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">ne izinguvu za Misili nazibule udumo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />Miye naniwatogeze wantu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:12">nawo nawanive na kunitunya miye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:12">Miye Chohile silonga.”<verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="s">Kugwa kwa wata nguvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />Vugula izinyivi zako, weye Lebanoni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:1">chani moto wize woke imiti yako ye myelezi!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Lombolezani, nyuwe miti ya misonabali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">kwaviya miti ya mielezi ihya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">Miti iyo mitindivu ibalangwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">Nyuwe miti ya mialoni ya Bashani, lombolezani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">kwaviya mbago itogile ifyekulwa!<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />Tegeleza izwi dyo usungu utendese dya wadimi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">Kwaviya madimilo yawo yedi yabalangwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">Tegeleza mbumo wa simba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">Saka ditimile dyo mto wa Yolodani dibalangwa!<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wadimi waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu, agamba, “Kwetende mdimi ywa ngoto zikwita kwe kuchinjwa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" />Waguzi wawo wazichinja mna hawa kukantilwa, waguzi wawo wagamba, ‘Zumbe Chohile atogolwe! Vino haluse chiwagoli.’ Hata wadimi wenye hawakuziwaonela mbazi.<verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" />Miye Chohile nagamba, sani wawonele mbazi vituhu wekazi wa muno mwe isi. Nanimleke chila mntu mwe mikono ya mnyawe, na chila mwikazi mwe mikono ya seuta ywakwe. Awo nawakome wantu mwe isi, miye sanikombole mntu yoyose mwe mikono yawo.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Elo, nanitende mdimi ywe izingoto nendile zikegalwa kokuchinjwa, kwaviya nasihakilwa ni wadya wendile wakadamanya mayombe ye izingoto. Siguha nkome mbili, imwenga niyo naitanga “Mbazi” Intuhu siitanga “Umwenga.” Niyo naita nakudima izingoto. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />Kwa chipindi cha mwezi umwenga, sikoma wadimi watatu wehiye. Awo nendile hawakununga, miye siwajijimize. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" />Ivyo, siwagamba, “Sanitende mdimi ywenyu vituhu. Waleke wakubanika nawabanike, na wakwaga na wage! Awo nawasigale bubutane wenye kwa wenye.” <verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />Vikaheza niyo naguha idya inkome yangu niitange “Mbazi” naivuna, kulagisa kugamba lagano nidamanye na wantu mwe isi sidivuna. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />Lagano niyo dyavunwa mwe idizuwa idyo. Wadya wata mayombe ye zingoto wabanikilwe nendile wakanisinya niyo wamanya kugamba ni ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" />Akaheza nawagamba, “Uneva mnawona ni vyedi, nilihani maliho yangu, mna mnawona haviligane kwe ikalani nazo.” Ivyo, niyo waninka vihende milongo mitatu vya chumbu maliho yangu.<verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Akaheza Chohile anigamba, “Zike mwe hazina ye Inyumba yangu.” Maliho ayo yendaga yakaligana na miye mwe ndima yangu. Vihande ivyo milongo mitatu vye chumbu siviguha navidula mwe mpamba ye Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Akaheza niyo navuna idya inkome yangu ya kaidi niitange “Umwenga.” Ivyo sivuna umwe mgati mwa Yuda na Izulaeli.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />Chohile anigamba, “Kwetende vituhu mdimi, mna intamo ino utende enga mdimi mwihi! <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" />Kwaviya nanigale mdimi mwe isi hekutnduliya ngoto ikwaga, hegu kulonda ngoto ikwangadika, hegu kuinka mti ilumile naho kuzidima ziya izinjima. Mna ziya izingoto zinonile nazidye ne izingaga zose.” <verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" />“Mdimi ehiye naluwone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">yudya nazileke izingoto zakwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">Bamba nadikante umkono wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">ziso dyakwe dya kulume ding'olwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">Mkono wakwe uholomale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">ziso dyakwe dya kulume ditulike.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="s">Mzi wa Yelusalemu naukombolwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />Ulosi wa Chohile ukulanga Izulaeli. Zumbe Chohile atantalike ulanga nuyo aikiye chegamo che isi na kumwinka mntu ujima agamba, <verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" />“Mzi wa Yelusalemu naniutende uge chikombe cha divai na wantu mwe izisi zikuuzunguluka nawanywe na kusebeduka uge mkozi. Umo mzi wa Yelusalemu ukwebungwa hata imizi yose ya Yuda nayebungwe. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" />Zuwa idyo umo wantu we izisi zose wadugane chani wawebunge umzi wa Yelusalemu naniutende uzame uge yuwe hedikudaha kusogezwa ni mntu. Yoyose nadinule nelumize mwenye. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" />Miye Zumbe Chohile nagamba chila falasi naniijele nkama mkwela falasi ywakwe namlalusa. Falasi za wantu we izisi ntuhu nanzitule ameso. Mna wantu we idikabila dya Yuda naniwadime. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />Naho vilongozi wa Yuda nawagambilane, ‘Wekazi wa Yelusalemu wapata nguvu kulawa kwa Zumbe Chohile Nta Nguvu Zose.’”<verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />“Zuwa idyo, vilongozi wa Yuda nani watende enga nyungu ya moto makali mwe mbago, heye uge mwale ukwaka mgati mwe machisa. Nawawakome wantu wose we mnkandankanda mwawo. Mna wantu wa Yelusalemu na wajendeleze kwikala mpeho mo mzi wawo.”<verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />“Miye Zumbe Chohile nanikonge kuwambiza walukolo wa Yuda chani welekwa wa Daudi na wekazi wa Yelusalemu wanase kwewona ni wabala kujinka wantu watuhu wa makabila ya Yuda. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" />Zuwa idyo, miye Zumbe Chohile nani wadime wekazi wo mzi wa Yelusalemu, wasokelese kujinka wose mgati mwawo nawatende na nguvu saviya seuta Daudi. Welekwa wa Daudi nawawalongoze wantu wa Yuda enga mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile akawalongwela.” <verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" />“Zuwa idyo, naniwakome wantu we izisi zose zikunga kuwebunga umzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />Welekwa wa Daudi na wekazi wo mzi wa Yelusalemu nani wamyeme loho ya mbazi na malombezo. Awo nawamsinye yudya watungile, nawamlombolezeze uge mntu akumwiila mwanawe ywe chedu, hegu enga mntu akumwiila kwa chinyulu mwelekwa ywakwe ywa nkongo. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" />Zuwa idyo mo mzi Yelusalemu namtende na ndilo nkulu enga ndilo ya kumlomboleza Hadadi limoni mo luwala lwa Megido. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12" />Wantu mwe isi nawalomboleze, chila wantu mwe lukolo nawalomboleze wenye, wavyele ichedu na wagosi ichedu, lukolo lwa Daudi ichedu na lukolo lwa Nasani ichedu, <verse eid="ZEC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13" />lukolo lwa Lawi ichedu na lukolo lwa Shimei ichedu. <verse eid="ZEC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14" />Walukolo wose wasigale nawalomboleze wenye wakatenda na wavyele wawo”<verse eid="ZEC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />“Zuwa idyo, nakulaile sokwe za mazi ya kuwakukiza masa na wavu welekwa wa Daudi na wekazi wose wa Yelusalemu.” <verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />Chipindi icho, nagamba miye Chohile wawa nkondo, mazina ya vinyago vya vichohile ihasi nani yause, naho haya fanyanywe vituhu. Na wakwe fenya kugamba waoni nani wabalazize hale hamwenga na tama zawo za kuvikila sanam. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" />Mntu yoyose ne fenye kuga muoni, ise na nine wamweleke nawamgambe, Waungwa ubanike kwaviya walonga udanti kwa zina dya Chohile. Na welesi wakwe nawamtunge ngola akalotela. <verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" />Zuwa idyo, chila muoni nayaonele soni maono yakwe akalotela. Hawavale suche za mazoya chani wawadante wantu, <verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" />Mna chila yumwenga nagambe, “Miye suyo muwoni, miye ni mlimi du, sanga ino ni yangu kukongela ubwanga wangu.” <verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />Na mntu namuze yumwe ywawo, “‘Nkwenje zino unanazo komgongo zilawahi? Uyo naahitule, Nkwenje zino sizi pata mwe zinyumba za mbwiya zangu.’”<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ya Kumkoma Mdimi ywa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />Chohile wawa nkondo agamba vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">“Inuka weye bama!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">Inuka umtowe umdimi ywangu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">taile, mdimi akunidamanyiza ndima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">Mtowe mdimi ne zingoto zizagalikane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">Nanu uchuluse umkono wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">kuwatowa wantu wanyaile. <verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />Selusi mbili za wantu mwe isi nazikomwe;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:8">ni selusi imwenga du nesigale,<verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />Selusi iyo imwenga nesigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">nani ijeze kuitakasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">enga mntu akusunta hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">taile, enga viya vikujezwa zahabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">Aho wowo nawanilombeze miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">miye nami naniwahitule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">Nanilonge, ‘Wano ni wantu wangu.’”<verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />Kaula, zuwa dya maya ya Chohile dyeza. Zuwa idyo, nyuwe wantu wa Yelusalemu, ugoli wenyu no upangilwe mwa meso yenyu. <verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" />Chohile nayachisanye mataifa yose chani kuutowa umzi wa Yelusalemu. Mzi naugwilwe, nyumba zenyu nazigwilwe, na wavyele wenyu nawajende na wagosi wenji. Nusu ya wekazi wo mzi nawasamizwe, mna nusu neisigale haigalwe kuse komzi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Vikaheza Chohile nalawe na kuyatowa nkondo mataifa ayo, enga via akudamanyaga kale na kale mazuwa ya nkondo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" />Zuwa idyo, nachimale kolugulu lwa mizeituni wi ulailo wa zuwa wo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Lugulu ulo na lutulwe ntendele mbili na kolongo ditendese na dilaile kulaila ulailo wa zuwa kubula uswelo wa zuwa. Nusu imwenga naihinge chibula na nusu ntuhu kwa mwenye mzi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" />Nyuwe namguluke kujinkila idi kolongo idyo, mgatigati mwa magulu amaidi ya Chohile. Na mguluke enga wakale wenyu wagulukaga chisingisa che isi mwechipindi cho utawala wa zumbe Uzia wa Yuda. Akaheza Chohile, Chohile ywangu, neeze na watakaswa wose hamwenga yeye.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />Chipindi icho hakutende na mpeho hegu mpeho itendese. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" />Msi nojendeleze hekwina chiza kwingila. Chipindi icho chimanywa ni Chohile ichedu. Hakutende msi ukaleka chilo, kwaviya hata saa za chisingi unga'zi nautendeke aho.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />Chipindi icho, mazi ya ujima nayavile kulaila ko mzi wa Yelusalemu, na nusu ntuhu mwe bahali ya uswelo wa zuwa. Mzi ayo nayajendeleze kuvila chipindi che dizuwa enga ivyo yeli mwama sika.<verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" />Chipindi icho, Chohile natende nuyo zumbe ichedu ywe dunia yose; uyo natende nuyo Chohie ichedu, yumwenga du, na zina dyakwe naditende nidyo zina ichedu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />Isi yose, kukongela Geba kubula Rimoni, kwa mwenye mzi mwa Yelusalemu, nihitulwe kuta luwala luligane vitendese. Mna mzi wa Yelusalemu nausigale mlanga hantu hakwe kulaila chili ya Benjamini kubula chili ya kale, kubula mwe chili ya Konani, kukongela mnala wa Hanareli kubula mwedi shinikizo dya zumbe. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" />Mzi wa Yelusalemu nawikalwe ni wantu kwaviya mndani mwakwe hamtendeke na ligito dyodyose vituhu; taile, wantu nawekale umo kwa wedi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Mna vikuna wadya wantu wadya wezile kutowana na Yelusalemu, zino nizo file ziya Chohie naawegaile, Imili yawo naiwole wachei wakwikala; meso yawo nayawole yakata yachei mwe zintundu zakwe na izi limi zawo naziwole zichei mwemilomo yawo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" />Zuwa idyo, nkama kuulaila kwa Chohile ne iwengile wantu, na chila mntu na mtowe mnyawe. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" />Wantu wa Yuda nawatowane kudima umzi wa Yelusalemu; ugoli wa mataifa yose ya kwizunguluka isi ya Yuda na uchisanywe, nawachisanye zahabu, hela na suche kwa winji vitendese.<verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Fle zitendese na zilaile mwe zifalasi, nyumbu, ngamia, mpunda na wanyama wose nawaendeke mwe zinkambi izo za wankondo.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />Akaheza, chila mntu ahonile mgati mwa mataifa yose yezile kutowa umzi wa Yelusalemu, naatende akeza Yelusalemu mwaka kubula mwaka, kumvikila Chohile wawa nkondo yudya zumbe, na kuvinila zuwa kulu ya makumbi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" />Uneva taifa dyodyose hadiite Yelusalemu kumvikila Chohile wawa nkondo yudya zumbe, ivyo, fula hainye mwe isi yawo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />Uneva Wamisili wanalemela kuvinila idizuwa idyo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />Iyo naitende niyo inkanto nadiite idi taifa dya Misili hamwenga na mataifa yose heyekuvinila makumbi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />Chipindi icho, mwe zingaga zezi falasi nayaandikwe maandiko yano, “Weikigwe kwa Chohile.” Nyungu zi mwenyumba yo kuvikila dya Chohile na zitende enga mabakuli kulongole mwe mazabahu. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" />Chila nyungu mo mzi wa Yelusalemu na isi ya Yuda naikwe kwa Chohile wawa nkondo, chani wose wakulavya zabihu wadahe kuziguha na kwambikila nyama za zabihu. Chipindi icho, hakutende mtayombe yoyose mwe nyumba ya Chohile wawa nkondo yokuvikila.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>